        {
            // Canonical scenario AJ: a JSON null for the required,
            // non-nullable 'name' field must hard-fail with the SDK
            // deserialization error rather than silently building a partial
            // object (go zero-inits, python/kotlin accept — the canonical is
            // throw). C# already rejects it via the model constructor's
